{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561520/extras/b5a7cd4fab7b816c371d512686715161.avif?t=1766049301\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><i>-This is an adult-oriented game, anyone under the age of 18 shouldn't play this game-</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extended Stay is a monster-girl brothel management simulation where your success relies on keeping your guests happy. By fulfilling their desires, you\u2019ll unlock sex scenes and earn the money needed to keep your brothel running. As your business expands, you can hire more employees, unlock new races and costumes, and attract wealthier clientele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 fully interactive sex scenes based on your input</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience each sex scene from an immersive POV perspective</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated guests and characters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique monster-girl races to choose from</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth character customization with a wide selection of clothing and accessories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Extended Stay, both characters and guests are procedurally generated, from breast size to personality and sexual preferences. Each employee you hire plays a distinct role in your brothel, catering to specific desires of your guests. As they work, employees gain experience and improve their skills, becoming better equipped to please guests. Over time, employees may develop attractions to each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once an employee forms a strong attraction, you can pair them with another employee for a sex scene of your choosing. The sex scenes in Extended Stay are fully interactive, giving you complete control over the action. Using your mouse, you can adjust speed and movement across all 16 unique sex positions.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1561520/a14a47aa82768b2fe451711c5748ae43ac4e3e5c.jpg"},{"name":"Full House","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1561520/20995442f1843196f580526acd06b96897037c0d.jpg"},{"name":"Happy Customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1561520/4506d1130625f965071ff3812c78eec1bedc4391.jpg"},{"name":"The Club","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1561520/deb3be80cf31be6c5a26f4747a3d268d5b923cd4.jpg"},{"name":"In The Green","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1561520/24cc2b66e2467158d8f6c2b03795e4ae60bedb3e.jpg"},{"name":"5K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1561520/2c2ace3be73de2b4ffdabd2df868653be8143a02.jpg"},{"name":"10K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1561520/ee63adba84f41460c21bad1e1968e3e941195cc7.jpg"},{"name":"100K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1561520/905cb4c17a033c4fbc15e08281bb307604e5fa25.jpg"},{"name":"Variety","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1561520/85c2656505e7e17e92631f54fab5396ad5b86a2f.jpg"},{"name":"Fashionable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1561520/6429f097bf40398a0d8fe9a0da7cc0b520f2b446.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1561520?t=1766049301","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite